.com/x/cover/mzc00200o2tjlti.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":59,"network":null,"webChannel":{"id":104,"name":"Tencent QQ","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/"},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/646/1615698.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/646/1615698.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Modern-day best friends Tian Yuyuan and Lin Shutiao unexpectedly find themselves transported into a novel about household power struggles. They become sisters-in-law destined to be framed in a flower boat scandal on their wedding night and die together as sacrificial characters. The two team up to thwart the eldest sister-in-law and the adopted daughter, Shen Wanwan, as they expose one scheme and trap after another, making money along the way to survive. Shen Cheng, the cold and aloof heir, is afflicted with a deadly poison and needs the heroine's blood to stay alive, while Shen He, the unruly third young master, secretly aspires to become a coroner. Romance gradually blossoms between the two couples. However, the reborn original heroine Song Zhang and the Third Prince, who plots rebellion, launch a series of attacks. The four join forces to investigate an old case at Qiyun Pass, find witnesses who can testify to the injustice, and expose the Third Prince's serious crimes. They clear the Shen family's name and ultimately escape their predetermined tragic fate, living peacefully together.</p>","updated":1792173345,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/95027"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3790066","name":"Episode 14"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3790067","name":"Episode 15"}}}}},{"id":3793079,"ur